- XaviXEmu is the submodule extern/XaviXEmu, at a pinned commit, with the two
  small patches in patches/ laid over it when this repository is built. Its
  emulation sources (src/core and src/sha1.c, the parts this repository
  builds) and tests/upstream-harness.c, which is a short program of XaviXEmu's
  own kind, are under the BSD 3-Clause License, copyright Billy Jr. and
  contributors; see extern/XaviXEmu/LICENSE. XaviXEmu says its hardware
  behaviour was adapted from MAME source files marked BSD-3-Clause; its
  THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.md lists them. The miniz library XaviXEmu carries
  (extern/XaviXEmu/third_party/miniz) is under the MIT License. XaviXEmu's
  Windows front end (src/main.c and the files around it) is not built here.

- BUILT ARTIFACTS (core.wbx and the xavixemu.chimeraCore package) contain this
  repository's code, XaviXEmu's emulation sources and miniz: MIT and
  BSD-3-Clause, and nothing else. The package carries the licence texts.

- No game is part of this repository or of the package. The games are
  other people's, and the user brings them.

